{
  "version": 1,
  "_about": "Hand-made PONY guns. A unique is saved as its id plus the gun it stands for; core/gun_gen.gd rebuilds it from this file and refuses any copy that differs. Every unique gets: the listed parts (all made by the gun's own maker, so the factory-perfect bonus applies), all seven stat rolls at the maximum, three buffs and two skills at full quality, and the `bonus` below on top. `drop_chance` = how often a pony-tier drop is one of these. All names and numbers are placeholders for the director. CHASE GUNS (diary/DESIGN_UNIQUES.md) add: red = the red text on the card, signature = its hand-made behaviour (game/signatures/<id>.gd), attach = its gimmick model (assets/models/weapons/uniques/<id>.gltf), keeps = a number the gun itself remembers (\"record\": Fish Story's biggest hit; the host allows it on that unique only), cfg = numbers its behaviour reads, pool = the loot pool it drops from (data/loot_pools.json; no pool = any pony drop anywhere). PLAIN UNIQUES (no red text, no signature) may also carry traits and a sea affix (\"sea\").",
  "drop_chance": 0.25,
